        348.4,
        296.25
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "在平面直角坐标系中，我们可以利用上述规律画出与一个图形关于x轴或y轴对称的图形．对于一些规则的几何图形，只要先求出已知图形中的一些关键点（如三角形的顶点）关于坐标轴对称的点的坐标，描出并连接这些点，就可以得到与这个图形关于坐标轴对称的图形."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        78,
        418,
        874,
        526
      ],
      "reading_order": 7,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        169,
        1283,
        1900,
        1615
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        88,
        668,
        989,
        841
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        40.68,
        308.05,
        455.84,
        387.64
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "例2如图15.2-4，四边形ABCD的四个顶点的坐标分别为A（—5，1)，B(—2，1)，C(—2，5)，D(—5，4)，画出与四边形ABCD关于y轴对称的图形."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        78,
        532,
        869,
        581
      ],
      "reading_order": 8,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        169,
        1633,
        1889,
        1784
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        88,
        851,
        983,
        929
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        40.68,
        392.06,
        453.23,
        428.17
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解：点（x，y）关于y轴对称的点的坐标为（一x，y），因此四边形ABCD的顶点A，B，C，D关于y轴对称的点分别为 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime } ( 5 , \\ 1 )"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "B ^ { \\prime } ( 2 , \\ 1 )"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "C ^ { \\prime } ( 2 , \\ 5 )"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "D ^ { \\prime } ( 5 , \\ 4 )"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，依次连接 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "C ^ { \\prime } D ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "D ^ { \\prime } A ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，就可得到与四边形ABCD关于y轴对称的四边形 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A ^ { \\prime } B ^ { \\prime } C ^ { \\prime } D ^ { \\prime }"
          }
        ]
      },
